{"sections":[{"slug":"量子Heisenberg模型","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"量子Heisenberg模型"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">量子</span> Heisenberg <span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“量子 Heisenberg 模型”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">数学物理</span></p>\n<p>Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">空间为</span> $(\\mathbb{C}^2)^{\\otimes N}$, Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量为</span>\n$$\r\n\\hat H = -J \\sum_{j=1}^N \\sigma_j \\sigma_{j+1} - h \\sum_{j=1}^N \\sigma_j\\,(\\sigma_{N+1}=\\sigma_1).\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\hat{H}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_{j=1}^{N}(J_x\\sigma_j^x\\sigma_{j+1}^x+J_y\\sigma_j^y\\sigma_{j+1}^y+J_z\\sigma_j^z\\sigma_{j+1}^z+h\\sigma_j^z).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Pauli矩阵","text":"Pauli <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/AKLT模型","text":"AKLT <span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}